  "caveats": [
    "synthetic corpus: TSAT time-domain simulation of the WECC 240-bus model, not field PMU; the real-data leg of E2.G is the ISO-NE case study",
    "the secondary detection branch is descriptive only: at a 10% window false alarm a 60 s region alarms by chance with high probability, so the detection COUNT carries no significance claim (disclosure A.16.3); the latency distribution is the informative quantity",
    "forcing start is exact by simulation design (t=30 s); the early-warning onset is estimated in-band with an ambient-only baseline",
    "observable is per-bus voltage magnitude \u2014 the same observable family the detector was certified on"
  ],
